  "problem_statement": "The unicoap options module should support a compile-time configuration flag `CONFIG_UNICOAP_OPTIONS_FULL_SUPPORT` (checked via `IS_ACTIVE`). When this flag is not active, option manipulation must be restricted to in-order additions only: adding an option whose CoAP option number is lower than the last already-added option must return -ENOTSUP; setting (changing) an option that already exists must return -ENOTSUP; and removing options must return -ENOTSUP. When the flag is active (the default), the existing full-support behavior\u2014adding, changing, and removing options in any order\u2014must continue to work unchanged.",
